Oxus, whom [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] call Oxide or the professor lady, is a scholar of [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyara]]. She keeps an office in the city, walled with book stacks and a window that looks out over the interior, and it is shielded against teleportation. [[People/Althane/The Broker|The Broker]] comes and goes from it by a bookshelf that shimmers open when she makes the way for him.

After the [[People/Althane/The Crystalpoint Lattice|Crystalpoint Lattice]] was excised, Oxus was set over the [[Org/Althane/The Trust|Trust]] at [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]]'s word, the first head it had chosen for itself. She is power-hungry and used her new place at once to settle old scores, and her rule over the Trust is expected to be a bumpy one. She is the only person in the [[Org/Althane/The Network|Network]] who had met the Broker and knew their face, and she keeps her ties there while serving her own interests.
